### Contoh request — Case 2: Barang Masuk
### Jalankan dengan VS Code extension "REST Client", atau tiru di Postman.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5050/api

### Login admin pusat (atau admin site)
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "admin123" }

###
@token = TEMPEL_TOKEN_DI_SINI

### ---------- CATAT BARANG MASUK ----------
### Barang lama + barang baru dalam satu transaksi (site Gunung Megang)
### Ganti inventoryId & categoryId sesuai data di databasemu.
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "siteId": 1,
  "remarks": "Pengadaan SCM PO-123",
  "items": [
    { "inventoryId": 4, "quantity": 20 },
    { "name": "Sarung Tangan Las", "unit": "pasang", "type": "CONSUMABLE", "categoryId": 4, "quantity": 10 }
  ]
}

### Hanya restock barang yang sudah ada
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "siteId": 1,
  "remarks": "Petty cash, nota Toko Maju",
  "items": [ { "inventoryId": 2, "quantity": 1 } ]
}

### ---------- DAFTAR & DETAIL ----------
GET {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Filter site, kata kunci, dan rentang tanggal (WIB)
GET {{baseUrl}}/goods-in?siteId=1&search=SCM&from=2026-11-01&to=2026-11-30
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Detail (ganti id) — berisi stok sebelum/sesudah tiap barang + timeline
GET {{baseUrl}}/goods-in/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### ---------- TAMBAH BARANG DENGAN STOK AWAL ----------
### quantity > 0 → otomatis tercatat sebagai barang masuk (lihat field goodsIn di response)
POST {{baseUrl}}/inventories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Tang Kombinasi", "unit": "ea", "type": "NON_CONSUMABLE", "categoryId": 1, "siteId": 1, "quantity": 2 }

### ---------- UJI ERROR YANG DIHARAPKAN ----------
### items kosong → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteId": 1, "items": [] }

### quantity 0 → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteId": 1, "items": [ { "inventoryId": 4, "quantity": 0 } ] }

### Barang yang sama dua kali → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteId": 1, "items": [ { "inventoryId": 4, "quantity": 1 }, { "inventoryId": 4, "quantity": 2 } ] }

### Barang milik site lain (misal id 5 milik POMS) → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteId": 1, "items": [ { "inventoryId": 5, "quantity": 1 } ] }

### Barang "baru" padahal namanya sudah ada di site → 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/goods-in
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "siteId": 1, "items": [ { "name": "Barton Chart", "unit": "ea", "type": "CONSUMABLE", "categoryId": 6, "quantity": 5 } ] }
